00:10:55.750 --> 00:11:02.180
Reina Spriggan was a test pilot who evaluated the performance of prototype mobile suits.

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:05.560
But one day, there was an accident.

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:06.520
