00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:26.540
You could never...

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:03.860
Good work on the evaluation test,

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:05.700
Lt. Commander Reina Spriggan.

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:08.910
Thanks, you too.

