00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:22.220
Good work, Reina.

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:26.260
Didn't do too bad today, did I?

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:29.060
Heh, listen to you.

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:35.150
The two of us met as fellow pilots.

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:40.610
We spent more and more time together as friendly rivals.

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:47.120
Sorry, were you waiting?

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:49.950
Yes, for quite a while.

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:02.720
Being a test pilot isn't too bad, eh?

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:03.670
You think?

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:10.100
We're here right now because we 
became test pilots, don't you think?

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:23.780
If it's with you, I feel like I can make an old dream come true.

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:27.950
My dream of having a happy family.{what a perv}

